OL,3,ATwo killed in 'massive' Ukrainian drone
OL,4,Aattack on Moscow region, says Russia
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Ukrainian official meanwhile said
OL,7,Feight people, including three children,
OL,8,Fwere killed in Russian attacks in the
OL,9,FKyiv and Sumy regions on Saturday.
OL,11,FRussia and Ukraine have recently
OL,12,Fintensified their strikes, targeting
OL,13,Fenergy-generating and transport
OL,14,Ffacilities, as well as major logistics
OL,15,Fhubs.
